    "chunk_text": "nis geworht nan \u00feing. Nis he na gesceapen, ne he nis na gesceaft, \u00feurh \u00feone \u00f0e syndon ealle \u00feing gesceapene. Ealle \u00fea gesceafta gesewenlice on worulde & \u00fea ungesewenlican on \u00feam uppheofone \u00fee \u00e6nige \u00d0a gesceafta syndon gesette on \u00ferim \u00feingum, In mensura et numero et pondere; \u00fe\u00e6t is on Engliscere N\u00e6s n\u00e6fre nan synn \u00feurh god gesceapen ne nan unrihtwisnyss ne yfel \u00feurh hine ac \u00feurh Godes willan & eft \u00feurh Adam on his forg\u00e6gednysse. N\u00e6f\u00f0 yfel nane wununge \u00fe\u00e6t hit wesan m\u00e6ge ahw\u00e6r buton on gesceaftum \u00fee gode w\u00e6ron Gode w\u00e6ron \u00fea englas fram Gode gesceapene & \u00fe\u00e6t yfel n\u00e6s \u00fea gyt nahw\u00e6r wunigende, ac hi hit God gesceop heofonas, him sylfum to wununge & his halgum englum \u00fee him gehyrsumedon, & eac Ac \u00e6fter Adames gylte us w\u00e6s seo eor\u00f0e bet\u00e6ht on to wunigenne on \u00feissere worulde, & God us \u00feeah Nytenu & orfcynn he forgeaf us to fultume, & wyrta to l\u00e6cedome & to wlite \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean, & orfe to Manega gesceafta mislice us drecca\u00f0 eall for urum synnum, \u00fe\u00e6t we swa tocnawon hw\u00e6s we wyr\u00f0e \u00d0in gelica \u00fee cwy\u00f0 to sum teonfullic word; \u00f0u modegast ongean, & ne miht \u00f0e bewerian wi\u00f0 flean on Swa w\u00e6s iu Pharao, \u00fee wann ongean God, se Egiptisca cy",
